WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.960
I don't understand.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.880
I suppose you would be confused.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:15.170
As you can see, the members of the
Giou Clan possess special powers.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.660
They are the symbol of our clan.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.390
It seems you know what I'm talking about.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.690
Your powers will continue to grow.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:36.560
You will fear your powers.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:40.150
I'm an ordinary high school student.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:41.300
I'm...

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.580
an ordinary...

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:49.350
If you come with us, we will give
you knowledge, control,

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:54.760
and the means to cope with your powers.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:59.660
This is the best path for you, Yuki.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.780
Only I know your pain...

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.280
Your uncertainty...

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:17.200
Your loneliness...

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:22.330
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.800
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.970
I will not betray you!

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:23.930
Walpurgis Night

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.500
Can I have some time to think it over?

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:46.030
Of course. It's an important decision.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.740
But...

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.660
What are you going to do
about your powers?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.360
I'll think of something.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:56.880
I've managed just fine on
my own up till now.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:59.060
I can just keep on living like that.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:01.410
Umm...

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.340
Tsukumo-kun and Toko-san...

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.730
Why are you treating me like a stranger?

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:09.780
You call Tsukumo "Tsukumo-kun",
but I'm "Toko-san"? You're so mean!

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.860
That's discrimination! It's favoritism!
Bullying even!

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:15.120
Then, Toko-chan...

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.710
What is it, Yuki-chan?

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.770
Would that make you two...

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.500
my relatives?

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:28.130
Our surnames are Murasame, but I guess that,
since we're part of the same clan, we kinda are.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.300
I'm glad.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:34.520
I never imagined that I'd have relatives.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:39.730
It makes me so happy to
know that I'm not alone.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.270
Yuki-chan...

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:46.860
We'll be here for you. You'll never have
to worry about anything again.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.770
There, there.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.280
Takashiro-san.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.410
Won't that be a problem?

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:57.000
Oh, that's-

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.370
Takashiro uses his authority
to cause destruction.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.640
I wish you wouldn't put it like that.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:06.920
His authority...

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:13.280
He really is something else to be so concerned
over something so minor.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:16.700
Maybe he's just panicking?

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.740
I agree with Tsukumo.

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:20.500
Looks like you were wrong.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:25.060
Yuki won't turn out the
way you think he will.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.360
No, everything's going according to plan.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:35.470
He's useless if he's too easily seduced
by what we have to offer.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:40.870
We need someone who has the kindness
to sacrifice himself for others...

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.540
and the strength to endure that pain.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.290
Yuki will come with us.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.510
Can't we leave him be?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.300
That's impossible.

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.680
Toko and Tsukumo, the Zweilt, will
be unable to fight without Yuki.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.540
If that happens, this world will end.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:09.320
You should know that.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.200
Yuki-chan would never want that.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.320
Zess.

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:22.040
Stay away from Yuki for a while.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:25.990
Don't tell him the Duras
are after him, either.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:34.030
He'll feel too secure with you by his side,

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.900
and his true powers will never awaken.

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:43.180
We have to take drastic measures.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.010
Don't do it, Zess!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.070
Takashiro-sama.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.870
What are you doing, Zess?

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.520
Takashiro...

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:14.590
I'll kill anyone who tries to hurt Yuki.

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:29.510
What a fascinating look you
had in your eye, Zess.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:48.830
Another Duras. I've never been able
to see one so clearly before.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.480
Zess-san.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.090
I'll go with you.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.740
I'm sorry. Can we stay like this for a while?

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:29.180
You'll be fine. I'm here.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:32.080
What's Zess's problem?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:36.400
He's always throwing a fit
like he's next door's cat.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.970
We need him.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:42.960
With that level of power,
he can do it without spells.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.970
He's a valuable resource.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.670
I'm not asking you to understand Zess.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.290
You just need to work with him.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:53.900
Understood?

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:56.980
Yes.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.870
Have you calmed down?

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.330
Yes.

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:11.540
I'm sorry. I know I said I could
handle things on my own,

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.030
but I was suddenly rooted to the spot.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:20.220
I thought the Duras might be after me.

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:24.430
Stay away from Yuki for a while.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:27.750
Don't tell him the Duras
are after him, either.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.170
If...

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.920
If that's the case...

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:39.320
and something were to happen
to the children because of it,

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:40.950
I...

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:52.060
Don't go outside tomorrow night.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:55.040
It's Walpurgis Night...

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:58.470
The night when the moon
is stained with blood.

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:01.940
We display our powers in the
name of our master...

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:04.050
and celebrate the festival of Walpurgis.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:09.610
Walpurgis?

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.690
Good work today.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:18.690
I'm heading back. Keep an eye on Yuki.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:21.900
Take care of yourselves, too.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:22.840
Okay.

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.720
Drive.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.750
Hey, Tsukumo.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:42.130
I wonder if we can just leave Yuki-chan
alone, like Zess said.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:46.790
Perhaps.

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.790
Hello, this is Giou.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:59.300
Yes, I have another favor
to ask of the director.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.840
Yes. Talk to you later.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.450
Will Kasumigaseki be all right?

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:09.570
Yes.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.480
It would certainly make things easier
if the Duras only showed up...

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.780
in areas where we've set up barriers.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.720
You have my sympathies.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:23.490
We won't see any significant threat from
them until they attack tomorrow.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.670
I'm not looking forward
to fighting an old foe.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:30.930
I suppose we need some kind
of insurance, though.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.670
Thank you.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.470
Don't forget what I told you.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.110
Don't go out tomorrow night.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.360
Don't even be alone if you can help it.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.280
Got that?

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.000
Go.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.050
Okay.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.900
Um...

00:11:55.420 --> 00:12:00.460
I feel like I've known you
for a very long time.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.430
I'm not sure why, though.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:06.950
Hurry.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:07.890
Okay.

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.410
It's too late.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.170
Reiga!

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.640
Takashiro-sama. Takashiro-sama!

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:02.080
Are you all right, Takashiro-sama?

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:04.640
It sounded like you were
having a nightmare.

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:07.570
I'm just overtired.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:19.620
I can't stop until I've settled
the score with him.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:25.130
Reiga the Necromancer...

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:42.230
What happens on Walpurgis Night?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:48.670
Once a year when the moon
turns red, they rise up.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:51.070
You mean... the Duras?

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:56.500
Most Duras are lesser demons,
known as Nidatorehi,

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.330
hiding in the shadows of the human heart...

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:02.930
but on Walpurgis Night, their
demonic powers grow,

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.070
and they cause harm to humans.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:11.990
Is something really going to
happen tomorrow night?

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:17.740
What's wrong?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.430
The princess...

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.480
What happened to the princess
and the prince?

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:30.170
Let's go back to your room.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.150
It's time for bed, everyone.

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:38.970
Okay!

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:45.080
The princess and the prince met again...

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:49.580
when the moonlight illuminated
the wild landscape.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:54.460
However, the princess looked sad.

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:59.720
The prince gently took the princess's hand.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:07.400
I will not betray Yuki.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:12.230
I won't leave you, Luka.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:20.560
I've always been jealous of people
in long-lasting relationships.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:24.010
I had no one.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:29.890
Thank you for finding me, Luka.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:52.700
Thank you.

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:09.250
Hello?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.430
This is Sakurai. Sorry to call you so early.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.930
It's fine.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:18.340
I've given it a lot of thought,

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:22.690
but I just can't go to Tokyo.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.330
Are you sure?

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:31.940
I'm sorry, but I've lived here my
whole life. This is my home.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:36.300
I feel there's still something
left for me to do here.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.410
That's your final answer?

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.320
Yes.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:45.890
Very well. If you ever need
anything, let me know.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.370
All right, thank you. Goodbye.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.840
Yuki won't turn out the
way you think he will.

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.350
Ibuki, get the car.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:13.440
We're done here. I'll be back soon.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.270
Very well.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.570
This is why I hate children.

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:25.500
I guess I won't see them again.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.790
Not even Zess-san...

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:35.400
Why do I feel so sad?

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.640
How's Yuki doing?

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.890
Nothing seems to have changed.

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:49.850
Don't let him out of your sight.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:50.350
Okay.

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:54.670
And stay away from Yuki, too.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.320
Understood.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.500
What about Zess?

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:01.030
He doesn't seem to have
moved since last night.

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.370
I see.

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.640
All right.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:18.670
Soon... Soon the moon will turn red.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.600
What? They still haven't come home?

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:33.670
I couldn't find them anywhere
in the orphanage.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.130
Is something wrong?

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.190
Oh, Yuki-kun.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:39.440
Rina-chan and Mami-chan
haven't come back yet.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.730
Could you help us look for them, Yuki-kun?

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:43.530
Sure.

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.750
Don't go out tomorrow night.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:04.220
Yuki!

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:11.450
Zess. Zess, can you hear me?

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:12.850
Tsukumo?

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.750
Yuki has left the house.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.850
What's Yuki doing?

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:20.590
I've lost track of Yuki's consciousness.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:26.640
Toko-chan and I are looking for him,
but I think someone's interfering.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:53.990
What a nuisance.

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.330
I don't have time for this.
Get out of my way!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.010
Damn it. Where are you, Yuki?

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:36.560
Concentrate. Concentrate and
find Yuki's consciousness.

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.300
Just wait. I'll be right there.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.380
Toko-chan. Toko-chan!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:54.960
Tsukumo?

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.310
I found Yuki, just for a second.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.130
He's probably at school.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.050
Let's meet up and...

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:04.900
No, he's close. I'll go ahead.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.880
No! Tsukumo, it's too dangerous
to go by yourself!

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:10.420
Tsukumo! Tsukumo!

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:14.540
Tsukumo...

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:46.210
Yuki...

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:49.590
If everyone was more like you,

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:55.430
I...

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:38.320
I have Luka and Takashiro-san
in front of me.

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:41.290
Which one will open his mouth first?

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:45.620
What are you talking about? I'm an
adult. I'll handle the preview.

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:46.730
It's been fifteen seconds, Takashiro.

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:47.370
Lost Days and White Future

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:49.970
Looks like you finally opened
your mouth, Zess.
